# User Story 13 and 14 – Customer Profile & Personalisation

## Story 13: View Customer Profile

**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 3 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to view my profile information and account settings,  
So that I can manage my account details and quickly access personal options.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Customer profile card displayed in settings
- Username/avatar visible
- Easy access to saved stores
- Easy access to order history
- Navigation available from settings page

### Business Value
Improves user convenience and strengthens account engagement.


## Story 14: Explore Restaurants

**Priority:** High  
**Estimate:** 4 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to browse available restaurants and cuisines,  
So that I can quickly discover food options.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Restaurant list page available
- Delivery fee shown
- Ratings displayed
- Sustainability score shown
- View details button available
- Save restaurant button available

### Business Value
Core browsing experience that drives ordering behaviour.


## Story 18: View Order History

**Priority:** High  
**Estimate:** 3 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to view my past and current orders,  
So that I can track purchases and reorder easily.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Orders screen available
- Empty state shown if no orders
- Past orders listed in cards
- Customer name shown
- Delivery address shown
- Phone number shown
- Order status visible

### Business Value
Encourages repeat usage and increases customer trust.


## Story 19: Change Theme & Accent

**Priority:** Medium  
**Estimate:** 2 Ideal Days  

### Description
As a customer,  
I want to customise the app theme and accent colours,  
So that I can personalise the app experience.

### Acceptance Criteria
- Dark mode toggle available
- Accent colour options available
- Theme changes instantly
- Reset settings button available
- Preference retained during session

### Business Value
Improves user satisfaction and app personalisation.
